{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_05_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_05","title":"通往舞会的邀请函","storyCode":"SS-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"80d7537bc135289190645359dd7f5dbf2a81d6a9b4818f7d194b34f5270b1b7f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"祥子从莫菲丝的口中得知睦的梦境并不简单。“睦”在这个梦里得到了自己想要的人生，为此拒绝了尝试拯救她的祥子，将其推下了山崖。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g6_rmbtmine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......唔......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉闷的声音在空旷的洞穴中回荡，那是附近仍未停止作业的掘地机发出的声响。\n气温越来越低。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"跑出洞穴的那一刻，寒意同时到来。\n而寒冷，只会让她心脏的跳动不断加快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该......该怎么面对她？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无法开口，无法面对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧啧，该如何是好呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无须回头，她已然知道来者是谁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子的梦境，我真的很满意呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦城堡的职责就是让每个孩子都有一场好梦，我一一实现了她的愿望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到这个梦境意外地运行得很稳定——不，甚至完美无缺，完全超出了我的预期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且在这里，有一些很有趣的事情正在发生哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在欺骗她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，这可不算欺骗。我和她交易了很多次，她很清楚我的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到这个结果，我也很开心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算意识到是梦境，依旧不愿意离开，那不正说明我的造梦技艺无人能比吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（赞同的哼唧声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，最后来的竟然是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不打扰你们了~丰川祥子，相信你很快也会发现这个梦境的有趣之处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，大家都在等着你呢。回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看着莫菲丝消失，却没有一点惊讶......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的一切，都是我们虚构出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，不属于我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g9_warmrabbitnest"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，你弹得好棒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，妈妈......祥，她去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥？可能去别的什么地方了吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不对。祥......祥她不可能丢下我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"欢呼的人群突然变得一片死寂，所有人都直勾勾地盯着睦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，你好像忘记了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不是你一个人的梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦的母亲”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是“我们”的梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这个梦境里，每一个“睦”都有机会实现自己的愿望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们和小睦一起，构建出了只属于我们的美梦——大家都能得到幸福的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在小睦的脑海中存在，观看了无数遍她的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后，我们一致认为，对于所有的“睦”来说，这就是最好的结局——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，丰川祥子，你是这个美梦的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，你这是在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不希望你痛苦下去，但是我们都不该躲在这样的梦里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小睦能在这里幸福地生活下去才是最重要的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和大家不一样，我想和祥子好好谈谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以留在这里，和我一起，守护小睦的美梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦是一个脆弱的孩子，她可能还无法决定，到底是醒来，还是就这样幸福下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你也选择留在这里，帮我们一起让这个梦一直做下去，那它自然就会变成“现实”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是“现实”唯一的基准，你即“现实”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，留下来吧，祥子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......拒绝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦现实中的身体正躺在冰冷的梦城堡里，你觉得这样的结局也是好的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的足够爱她的话，就不会做出这样的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能让小睦开心，只要我们都能存在——是不是现实又有什么关系？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拥有小睦的所有记忆，我知道你心里最需要什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你愿意留在这里，我甚至能给你一个完整的Ave{@nbs}Mujica！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！你根本就不是睦......睦不会这样说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢你，也喜欢小睦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么要让我陷入两难？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫名的声音盘旋在两人的头顶上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远方的山脉好像在震动，地上的碎石也有节奏地跳动了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"周围明明没有其他人，可祥子却觉得好像有无数双眼睛正在盯着自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说得对。我们对于小睦来说，就是无数的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了让影子能一直躲在黑暗里，再微弱的光也要掐灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“睦”一点点将祥子逼到了悬崖边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要做什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“睦”伸出了手，将手放在了祥子的肩上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i08"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子失去了平衡，“睦”离她越来越远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，我想要小睦一直快乐下去，我也想要所有的“睦”都不再消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是我没有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，不需要你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“求求你，从此再也不要放开——”\n“永永远远，再也不要放开”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"永别了，祥子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
